{"type":"sentences","items":[{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-dr1","topic":"build-daily-routine","en":"I am learning to drive.","note":"“To” + verb — a + infinitive across the Romance languages.","es":["Estoy","aprendiendo","a","conducir"],"fr":["J’apprends","à","conduire"],"it":["Sto","imparando","a","guidare"],"pt":["Estou","aprendendo","a","dirigir"],"ja":["{私|わたし}は","{運転|うんてん}を","{習|なら}っています"],"zh":["我","在","学","开车"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-dr2","topic":"build-daily-routine","en":"I usually wake up early.","note":"Adverbs of frequency like “usually” typically come before the verb.","es":["Normalmente","me despierto","temprano"],"fr":["D’habitude,","je me réveille","tôt"],"it":["Di solito","mi sveglio","presto"],"pt":["Normalmente","eu acordo","cedo"],"ja":["{私|わたし}は","いつも","{早|はや}く","{起|お}きます"],"zh":["我","通常","很早","起床"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-dr3","topic":"build-daily-routine","en":"Yesterday I cleaned the whole house.","note":"Simple past tense — an action finished yesterday, in six different systems.","es":["Ayer","limpié","toda","la casa"],"fr":["Hier,","j’ai nettoyé","toute","la maison"],"it":["Ieri","ho pulito","tutta","la casa"],"pt":["Ontem","eu limpei","a casa","toda"],"ja":["{昨日|きのう}、","{家中|いえじゅう}を","{掃除|そうじ}しました"],"zh":["我","昨天","打扫了","整个房子"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-dr4","topic":"build-daily-routine","en":"I have never missed a day of work.","note":"“I have never” — an experience that’s never happened, marked differently in every language.","es":["Nunca","he faltado","un día","al trabajo"],"fr":["Je n’ai","jamais","manqué","un jour de travail"],"it":["Non","ho mai","saltato","un giorno di lavoro"],"pt":["Nunca","faltei","um dia","de trabalho"],"ja":["{仕事|しごと}を","{休|やす}んだ","ことがありません"],"zh":["我","从来没有","请过","假"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-fs1","topic":"build-family-social","en":"My brother doesn’t play sports.","note":"Negation wraps around the verb — its shape shifts by language.","es":["Mi hermano","no","practica","deportes"],"fr":["Mon frère","ne","fait","pas de sport"],"it":["Mio fratello","non","fa","sport"],"pt":["Meu irmão","não","pratica","esportes"],"ja":["{私|わたし}の{兄|あに}は","スポーツを","しません"],"zh":["我哥哥","不","喜欢","运动"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-fs2","topic":"build-family-social","en":"We should call our parents.","note":"“Should” as a softened obligation — deberíamos, devrions, dovremmo…","es":["Deberíamos","llamar","a nuestros","padres"],"fr":["Nous devrions","appeler","nos parents"],"it":["Dovremmo","chiamare","i nostri","genitori"],"pt":["Deveríamos","ligar","para nossos","pais"],"ja":["{両親|りょうしん}に","{電話|でんわ}した{方|ほう}が","いいです"],"zh":["我们","应该","给父母","打电话"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-fs3","topic":"build-family-social","en":"Could you help me with this, please?","note":"A request wrapped in a softer conditional — “could you,” not “can you.”","es":["¿Podría","ayudarme","con esto,","por favor?"],"fr":["Pourriez-vous","m’aider","avec ça,","s’il vous plaît ?"],"it":["Potrebbe","aiutarmi","con questo,","per favore?"],"pt":["Poderia","me ajudar","com isso,","por favor?"],"ja":["これを","{手伝|てつだ}って","いただけますか"],"zh":["你","可以","帮我","一下吗"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-fs4","topic":"build-family-social","en":"My sister is more talkative than me.","note":"“More ___ than” — a different comparative shape in every language.","es":["Mi hermana","es","más habladora","que yo"],"fr":["Ma sœur","est","plus bavarde","que moi"],"it":["Mia sorella","è","più chiacchierona","di me"],"pt":["Minha irmã","é","mais falante","que eu"],"ja":["{私|わたし}の{姉|あね}は","{私|わたし}より","おしゃべりです"],"zh":["我姐姐","比我","更","爱说话"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-te1","topic":"build-travel-experiences","en":"Yesterday I visited a new city.","note":"Simple past tense — an action finished yesterday, in six different systems.","es":["Ayer","visité","una ciudad","nueva"],"fr":["Hier,","j’ai visité","une nouvelle","ville"],"it":["Ieri","ho visitato","una nuova","città"],"pt":["Ontem","eu visitei","uma cidade","nova"],"ja":["{昨日|きのう}、","{新|あたら}しい{町|まち}を","{訪|おとず}れました"],"zh":["我","昨天","参观了","一座新城市"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-te2","topic":"build-travel-experiences","en":"If it rains, we’ll stay at the hotel.","note":"An “if” clause pairing a condition with what happens next.","es":["Si llueve,","nos quedaremos","en el hotel"],"fr":["S’il pleut,","nous resterons","à l’hôtel"],"it":["Se piove,","resteremo","in albergo"],"pt":["Se chover,","ficaremos","no hotel"],"ja":["{雨|あめ}が{降|ふ}ったら、","ホテルに","います"],"zh":["如果下雨，","我们","就待在","酒店"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-te3","topic":"build-travel-experiences","en":"I have never been to Japan.","note":"“I have never” — an experience that’s never happened, marked differently in every language.","es":["Nunca","he estado","en Japón"],"fr":["Je ne suis","jamais","allé","au Japon"],"it":["Non","sono mai","stato","in Giappone"],"pt":["Eu","nunca","fui","ao Japão"],"ja":["{日本|にほん}に","{行|い}った","ことがありません"],"zh":["我","从来没","去过","日本"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-te4","topic":"build-travel-experiences","en":"Can you recommend a good hotel?","note":"A polite request built from “can you” plus the base verb.","es":["¿Puedes","recomendar","un buen hotel?"],"fr":["Peux-tu","recommander","un bon hôtel ?"],"it":["Puoi","consigliare","un buon hotel?"],"pt":["Você pode","recomendar","um bom hotel?"],"ja":["いいホテルを","お{勧|すす}め","できますか"],"zh":["你","能","推荐","一家好酒店吗"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-op1","topic":"build-opinions","en":"The music is very loud.","note":"Adjectives agree with the noun — música/musique/musica are all feminine.","es":["La música","está","muy","fuerte"],"fr":["La musique","est","très","forte"],"it":["La musica","è","molto","forte"],"pt":["A música","está","muito","alta"],"ja":["{音楽|おんがく}が","とても","うるさいです"],"zh":["音乐","很","吵"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-op2","topic":"build-opinions","en":"This city is more expensive than that one.","note":"“More ___ than” — a different comparative shape in every language.","es":["Esta ciudad","es","más cara","que esa"],"fr":["Cette ville","est","plus chère","que celle-là"],"it":["Questa città","è","più cara","di quella"],"pt":["Esta cidade","é","mais cara","que aquela"],"ja":["この{町|まち}は","あの{町|まち}より","{高|たか}いです"],"zh":["这座城市","比","那座","贵"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-op3","topic":"build-opinions","en":"I think this book is very interesting.","note":"“I think that…” introduces an opinion — a clause built around creo/pense/penso que.","es":["Creo que","este libro","es muy","interesante"],"fr":["Je pense que","ce livre","est très","intéressant"],"it":["Penso che","questo libro","sia molto","interessante"],"pt":["Acho que","este livro","é muito","interessante"],"ja":["この{本|ほん}は","とても{面白|おもしろ}いと","{思|おも}います"],"zh":["我觉得","这本书","很","有趣"]},{"tier":"B1","id":"b1-op4","topic":"build-opinions","en":"In my opinion, we should leave early.","note":"“Should” as a softened obligation, framed as a personal opinion.","es":["En mi opinión,","deberíamos","salir","temprano"],"fr":["À mon avis,","nous devrions","partir","tôt"],"it":["Secondo me,","dovremmo","partire","presto"],"pt":["Na minha opinião,","deveríamos","sair","cedo"],"ja":["{私|わたし}の{意見|いけん}では、","{早|はや}く","{出発|しゅっぱつ}した{方|ほう}が","いいです"],"zh":["我认为","我们","应该","早点出发"]}]}